{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 2<sup>x</sup> + 2<sup>x</sup> + 2<sup>x </sup>+ 2<sup>x</sup> এর মান নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক)2<sup>x </sup>", "option2": "খ) 2<sup>x + 4</sup>", "option3": "গ) 2<sup>2x + 2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 2<sup>x + 2</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>2<sup>x</sup> + 2<sup>x</sup> + 2<sup>x </sup>+ 2<sup>x</sup> <br>= 2<sup>x</sup>(1 + 1 + 1 + 1)<br>= 2<sup>x</sup>. 4<br>= 2<sup>x</sup>. 2<sup>2</sup><br>= 2<sup>x + 2</sup> </p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) log<sub>10</sub>x = - 3 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক)  0.001", "option2": "খ)  0.01", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "দেয়াআছে&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>x = - 3<br />x = 10<sup>- 3</sup><br />x = 1/10<sup>3</sup><br />x = 1/1000<br />x = 0.001"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) 5<sup>2x - 6</sup> = 3<sup>2x - 6</sup> হলে x<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "4", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />5<sup>2x - 6</sup> = 3<sup>2x - 6</sup><br />5<sup>2x - 6</sup>/3<sup>2x - 6 </sup>= 1<br />(5/3)<sup>2x - 6</sup> = 1<br />(5/3)<sup>2x - 6</sup> = (5/3)<sup>0</sup><br />2x - 6 = 0&nbsp;<br />2x = 6&nbsp;<br />x = 3&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> = 3<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2 </sup>= 9"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 32 এর 2 ভিত্তিক লগারিদম কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 1/5", "option3": "গ) 1/4", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "4", "exp": "32 এর 2 ভিত্তিক লগারিদম = log<sub>2</sub>32<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= log<sub>2</sub>2<sup>5</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5 log<sub>2</sub>2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5 &times; 1<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 5&nbsp;"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) 3<sup>mx - 1</sup> = 3a<sup>mx - 2</sup> হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 2m ", "option2": "খ) 2/m ", "option3": "গ) m/2", "option4": "ঘ) m ", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />3<sup>mx - 1</sup> = 3a<sup>mx - 2</sup><br />3<sup>mx - 1</sup>/3 = a<sup>mx - 2</sup><br />3<sup>mx - 2</sup> = &nbsp;a<sup>mx - 2</sup><br />(3/a)<sup>mx - 2</sup> = 1<br />(3/a)<sup>mx - 2</sup> = (3/a)<sup>0</sup><br />mx - 2 = 0&nbsp;<br />mx = 2<br />x = 2/m&nbsp;"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) log<sub>10</sub>x + log<sub>10</sub>5 = 2 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 100", "option2": "খ) 20", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />log<sub>10</sub>x + log<sub>10</sub>5 = 2<br />log<sub>10</sub>(5x) = 2<br />5x = 10<sup>2</sup><br />5x = 100<br />x = 20&nbsp;"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) যদি 2<sup>x</sup> &times; 8<sup>1/5</sup> = 2<sup>1/5</sup> হয়, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 2/5", "option2": "খ) - 2/5", "option3": "গ) -1/5", "option4": "ঘ) 1/5", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,&nbsp;<br />2<sup>x</sup> &times; 8<sup>1/5 </sup>= 2<sup>1/5</sup><br />2<sup>x </sup>&times; (2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>1/5</sup> = 2<sup>1/5</sup>&nbsp;<br />2<sup>x</sup> &times; 2<sup>3/5 </sup>= 2<sup>1/5</sup>&nbsp;<br />2<sup>x</sup> = 2<sup>1/5</sup>/2<sup>3/5</sup><br />2<sup>x</sup> = 2<sup>(1/5 - 3/5)</sup><br />2<sup>x</sup> = 2<sup>(1 - 3)/5</sup><br />2<sup>x</sup> = 2<sup>-2/5</sup><br />x = - 2/5"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) যদি log<sub>10</sub>(x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 10) = 0 হয়, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />log<sub>10</sub>(x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 10) = 0<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 10 = 10<sup>0</sup><br />x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 10 = 1<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 9 = 0&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 2.x .3 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />(x - 3)<sup>2 </sup>= 0&nbsp;<br />x - 3 = 0&nbsp;<br />x = 3&nbsp;"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 3<sup>x</sup> - 3<sup>x - 1 </sup>= 18 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 0", "answer": "3", "exp": "3<sup>x</sup> - 3<sup>x - 1 </sup>= 18&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> - 3<sup>x</sup> .3<sup>- 1</sup> = 18&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> - 3<sup>x</sup>/3 = 18&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup>(1 - 1/3) = 18&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> . 2/3 = 18&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> = (18 &times; 3)/2&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> = 27&nbsp;<br />3<sup>x</sup> = 3<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;<br />x = 3"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) log<sub>10</sub>(a/b) + log<sub>10</sub>(b/a) = log<sub>10</sub>(a + b) এর মান হবে-", "option1": "ক) a + b = 1 ", "option2": "খ) a - b = 1 ", "option3": "গ) a = b ", "option4": "ঘ) ab = 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "log<sub>10</sub>(a/b) + log<sub>10</sub>(b/a) = log<sub>10</sub>(a + b)&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>{(a/b) &times; (b/a)} = log<sub>10</sub>(a + b)&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>(a + b) = log<sub>10</sub>1<br />a + b = 1&nbsp;"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) x<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>x</sup>, x = 2y হলে (x, y) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) (10,5)", "option2": "খ) (4,2)", "option3": "গ) (6,3)", "option4": "ঘ) (2,1)", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />x<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>x</sup> .............(1)<br />x = 2y.................(2)<br /><br />(1) নং হতে পাই,<br />(2y)<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>2y</sup><br />2<sup>y</sup> y<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>2y</sup><br />2<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>2y</sup>/y<sup>y</sup><br />2<sup>y</sup> = y<sup>y</sup><br />y = 2&nbsp;<br /><br />(2) নং হতে পাই,<br />x = 2 &times; 2&nbsp;<br />x = 4"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 2log<sub>10</sub>5 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - (1/2)log<sub>10</sub>4 = কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "3", "exp": "2log<sub>10</sub>5 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - (1/2)log<sub>10</sub>4&nbsp;<br />=log<sub>10</sub>5<sup>2</sup> + log<sub>10</sub>8&nbsp;- (1/2)log<sub>10</sub>2<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />=log<sub>10</sub>25 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - log<sub>10</sub>(2<sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup><br />=log<sub>10</sub>25 + log<sub>10</sub>8 - log<sub>10</sub>2<br />=log<sub>10</sub>{(25 &times; 8)/2}<br />=log<sub>10</sub>100<br />=log<sub>10</sub>10<sup>2</sup><br />=2log<sub>10</sub>10<br />=2 . 1&nbsp;<br />= 2"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) 2<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 128 হলে, 2x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "দেয়া আছে<br />2<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 128<br />2<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 2<sup>7</sup><br />2x + 1 = 7&nbsp;<br />2x = 6"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) 2log<sub>10</sub>5&nbsp; + log<sub>10</sub>3 = কত?", "option1": "ক) log<sub>10</sub>45", "option2": "খ) log<sub>10</sub>50", "option3": "গ) log<sub>10</sub>30", "option4": "ঘ) log<sub>10</sub>75", "answer": "4", "exp": "2log<sub>10</sub>5&nbsp; + log<sub>10</sub>3&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; + log<sub>10</sub>3&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>25 + log<sub>10</sub>3&nbsp;<br />log<sub>10</sub>(25 &times; 3)<br />log<sub>10</sub>75"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) (a<sup>l</sup>/a<sup>m</sup>)<sup>n</sup> &times; (a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>)<sup>l</sup> &times; (a<sup>n</sup>/a<sup>l</sup>)<sup>m</sup>&nbsp; এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) - 1", "option4": "ঘ) 1/2", "answer": "2", "exp": "(a<sup>l</sup>/a<sup>m</sup>)<sup>n</sup> &times; (a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>)<sup>l</sup> &times; (a<sup>n</sup>/a<sup>l</sup>)<sup>m</sup> &nbsp;<br />(a<sup>l - m</sup>)<sup>n</sup> &times;(a<sup>m - n</sup>)<sup>l</sup> &times; (a<sup>n - l</sup>)<sup>m</sup>&nbsp;<br />a<sup>n(l - m )</sup>&times; a<sup>l(m - n)</sup> &times; a<sup>m(n - l)</sup><br />a<sup>ln - mn</sup> &times; a<sup>lm - ln</sup> &times; a<sup>mn - lm</sup><br />a<sup>ln - mn + lm - ln